You may also fork and contribute changes back to this project.


2. Enterprise / commercial use

If you are a company with 10 or more employees, or you want to offer
The Lockfile as a hosted product, paid service, or commercial offering
to others, you need a commercial license.

Contact: https://thelockfile.dev


3. What you cannot do without a commercial license

  - Use this software at a company with 50+ employees
